2026-07-27T08:02:06.0437011Z i /tmp/Rtmpc80SP3/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:02:06.0437527Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:02:06.0438141Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:02:06.0438957Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:02:06.0439868Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:02:06.0441195Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:02:06.0442109Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
